然衔接，不零散堆砌：\n\n- 整体竖版构图，米白色底色，带轻微复古纸张肌理\n- 顶部：橙色复古衬线大字体「INDONESIA」，下方配小字「The Vibrant July Edition」，顶部左右有橙色垂坠色块装饰\n- 上半区：扁平化热带海景，蓝色海面、橙黄色落日、远处绿色岛屿，天空暖黄渐变；左右各一棵深绿色椰子树；海面漂浮一艘印尼传统黑身木船；右侧点缀一座橙红色巴厘岛风格凉亭\n- 中区两侧：拼接两块印尼巴迪克（Batik）风格几何纹样色块，左侧为蓝橙红菱形纹样，右侧为橙白花纹纹样\n- 下半区：斜向拼接黄、绿、橙大色块；左下角搭配白色贝壳、橙红色珊瑚；右下角搭配橙红色珊瑚、白色鸡蛋花（印尼国花）\n- 底部正中央：黑色衬线字体「OROLA」\n整体色彩明快饱满，主色调为橙红、明黄、湖蓝、墨绿、米白，银饰的真实金属质感与扁平插画背景形成层次对比，氛围复古清新。", "empty", false, 521300545, "randomize", "1k"], "inputs": [{"name": "image1", "link": 2, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image9", "label": "image9", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image9"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image10", "label": "image10", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image10"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspectRatio"}, "shape": 7, "name": "aspectRatio", "label": "aspectRatio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspectRatio"}, {"widget": {"name": "skip_error"}, "shape": 7, "name": "skip_error", "label": "skip_error", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "skip_error"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "lab